  "description": "The 365 SIGNATURE is the most powerfully equipped model in our Gravel range.\n• The SRAM Force XPLR eTap AXS 12-speed drivetrain is a technological marvel. It offers fast, smooth, and precise gear changes. Maintenance and adjustments are kept to a minimum.\n• The wheels are the highest-end DT SWISS GR 1600 Spline aluminium wheels on the market. They offer ultra-fast engagement and are tubeless ready.\n• SRAM Force eTap AXS HRD brakes provide the stopping power. The contact point adjustment allows for bite or progression, depending on your preference. They are paired with 180mm Centerline X rotors.\n• The ROCKSHOX Reverb AXS XPLR wireless dropper post is ultra-fast. With a simple press of the left lever the seat is down - ideal for the most technical riding.",
